SetApproval_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when vault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when token zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   ├── when spender zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   └── when all addresses non zero
      ├── when amount zero
      │  ├── it should clear the entry
      │  ├── it should emit ApprovalSet with zero
      │  └── it should make maxApproval return zero
      └── when amount non zero
         ├── given no prior entry
         │  ├── it should set the entry
         │  ├── it should emit ApprovalSet
         │  └── it should make maxApproval return the new amount
         └── given prior entry
            ├── it should overwrite the prior amount
            ├── it should emit ApprovalSet with the new amount
            └── it should make maxApproval return the new amount
